  "content": "<h1>聊天特效动画模组</h1><p><a href=\"LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Wulian233/Chat-Impressive-Animation?style=flat-square\" alt=\"GitHub协议\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/environment-client-1976d2?style=flat-square\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端\"> <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/972468/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/972468?style=flat-square&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;label=CurseForge\" alt=\"CurseForge下载量\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/chat-impressive-animation?label=Modrinth&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"Modrinth下载量\"></p><p>通过添加动画效果让聊天界面更美观，包括打开/关闭聊天框、发送消息等动画，同时移除了消息提示符</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fchat-impressive-animation%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chat-impressive-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"需搭配Cloth Config API\"></a></p><h2>📖 模组介绍</h2><p>本模组基于<a href=\"https://github.com/Ezzenix/ChatAnimation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chat Animation</a>开发，相比原版增加了更多动画效果与细节设计，并包含配置文件可自由定制每项功能。最重要的是本模组支持Fabric、Forge和Neoforge全平台。</p><p>对于1.20.4及以下版本，同样提供Forge支持，但不支持消息发送动画。</p><p>注：本模组与现实中的CIA无关，仅缩写名称相同。</p><h2>✅ 功能特性</h2><p>所有功能均可通过配置文件单独配置！</p><ul>\n<li>打开聊天框动画</li>\n<li>关闭聊天框动画</li>\n<li>消息发送动画（Forge不支持）</li>\n<li>动画时长配置</li>\n<li>消息淡入淡出效果</li>\n<li>移除消息提示符（mc1.19.1新增）</li>\n</ul><h2>✨ 效果截图</h2><p><img src=\"https://s11.ax1x.com/2024/02/19/pFYJyw9.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>💖 兼容性</h2><p>已为以下模组编写专用兼容代码：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>：支持通过Mod Menu直接打开配置界面</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/raised\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raised</a>：适配聊天框上移效果</li>\n</ul>",
